geometry, textures, materials, lights, transforms, input, motion, clearance,
performance, diagnostic testing and the causal development workflow.
Clearly label actual implementation, historical evidence, researched guidance
and proposed extensions. Include public-safe source citations and provenance.
No private ROMs, recordings, transcripts, context or unrelated artwork changes.
Keep root README GIF-first. Verify the real MeshBoard thread and published
artifact bytes separately from local rendering and human aesthetic approval.

